sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Edge as Edge Agent (Python)
    participant Filter as GateApiKeyAuthFilter
    participant API as Backend API (/api)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Edge,DB: TODAY: single-tenant, Gate has no site_id/camera_id split
    Edge->>Filter: POST /api/gates/register (X-Gate-Key)
    Filter->>Filter: validate X-Gate-Key header
    alt key valid or unset (dev fallback)
        Filter->>API: forward request
        API->>DB: upsert Gate(name, location, cameraRtspUrl, status=online)
        DB-->>API: Gate row (id)
        API-->>Edge: 200 OK {gateId}
    else key invalid
        Filter-->>Edge: 401 Unauthorized
    end

    loop every heartbeat interval
        Edge->>API: POST /api/gates/{id}/heartbeat (X-Gate-Key)
        API->>DB: update lastHeartbeatAt, status
        DB-->>API: ack
        API-->>Edge: 200 OK
    end

    Note over API,DB: GateService sweeps every 30s,<br/>marks stale heartbeats status=offline

    Note over Edge,DB: TARGET: registration becomes site-scoped,<br/>Camera(id, site_id, role, panel_type, calibration_json)<br/>created first, Gate(id, site_id, camera_id, direction) links to it
    Edge->>API: POST /api/v1/sites/{siteId}/cameras/register (tenant JWT or device key)
    API->>DB: create Camera(site_id, role=ANPR_GATE|OVERVIEW, status=online)
    API->>DB: create/link Gate(site_id, camera_id, direction=entry|exit)
    DB-->>API: Camera+Gate ids
    API-->>Edge: 200 OK {cameraId, gateId}
    loop every heartbeat interval
        Edge->>API: POST /api/v1/cameras/{id}/heartbeat
        API->>DB: update last_heartbeat_at, status
        Note right of API: Target adds: Redis presence key<br/>for horizontal STOMP fan-out
    end
